{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Yeremey, a ranger who returns to his home reserve to visit his father\u2014only to find him missing.<br>Explore the vast forest, uncover traces of the disappeared, and piece together the story hidden in notes, maps, and abandoned places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reserve is dangerous: poachers, wild animals, and the lingering impact of a corporation that disturbed the natural balance. Survive using your skills, protect the land, and discover what happened to your father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Walk through atmospheric forest zones and uncover abandoned industrial sites.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight poachers and defend yourself against aggressive animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect herbs and craft potions to heal, calm, or resist poison.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use watchtowers and campsites to prepare for raids and navigate the territory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find notes and records that reveal the story of your father and the corporation\u2019s secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track animals and make decisions that affect the balance of the ecosystem.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043190?t=1759939133","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043190?t=1759939133","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043190/206cfc8a7e97f922538c4f625cb611dfe88e9b95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759939133","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043190/206cfc8a7e97f922538c4f625cb611dfe88e9b95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759939133","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descrip